    <briefdescription>
<para>Test fixture for failure-path diagnostics. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses a <ref refid="class_failing_document_store" kindref="compound">FailingDocumentStore</ref> to inject ERR_DOC_NOT_FOUND into every storage call, verifying that <ref refid="classthemis_1_1document_1_1_store_backed_round_trip_editor" kindref="compound">StoreBackedRoundTripEditor</ref> correctly propagates errors rather than swallowing them. </para>
